              "updatedAt": 1795084816009
            },
            {
              "id": "uVnccIjqE857",
              "text": "Tab & Split Layout (Obsidian 90%+)",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "PpA6WVvdVnAs",
                  "text": "멀티 탭 열기 · 닫기 · 닫은 탭 복원(Ctrl+Shift+T) · 고정(Pin)",
                  "children": [],
                  "isFolded": false,
